//
//   npm run docs:reference          (npx tsx scripts/generate-docs-reference.ts)
//
// Fully generated files live in docs/reference/generated/. Hand-written pages may also contain generated regions,
//
//   <!-- generated:begin capabilities razorpay -->
//   ...
//   <!-- generated:end -->
//
// whose content this script rewrites. `test/docs/reference.test.ts` runs `generateAll()` and fails when a file on disk
// differs from what it returns. Every fact comes from the code: the OpenAPI document (built from the route table and
// the Zod schemas), the constants (including their doc comments), the adapters' `capabilities`, the adapters' mapping
// tables, `service-config.ts` (probed, not copied) and `.env.example`.
